les Performance &amp; Business Analysis</span></span></pre><pre class=" CodeMirror-line " role="presentation"><span role="presentation" style="padding-right: 0.1px;"><span cm-text="">​</span></span></pre><pre class=" CodeMirror-line " role="presentation"><span role="presentation" style="padding-right: 0.1px;"><span class="cm-header cm-header-3">### CodeAlpha Data Analytics Project</span></span></pre><pre class=" CodeMirror-line " role="presentation"><span role="presentation" style="padding-right: 0.1px;"><span cm-text="">​</span></span></pre><pre class=" CodeMirror-line " role="presentation"><span role="presentation" style="padding-right: 0.1px;"><span class="cm-strong">**Tools &amp; Technologies: **</span></span></pre><pre class=" CodeMirror-line " role="presentation"><span role="presentation" style="padding-right: 0.1px;"><span class="cm-strong">Python | Pandas | NumPy | Matplotlib | Jupyter Notebook</span></span></pre><pre class=" CodeMirror-line " role="presentation"><span role="presentation" style="padding-right: 0.1px;"><span cm-text="">​</span></span></pre><pre class=" CodeMirror-line " role="presentation"><span role="presentation" style="padding-right: 0.1px;"><span cm-text="">​</span></span></pre><pre class=" CodeMirror-line " role="presentation"><span role="presentation" style="padding-right: 0.1px;"><span cm-text="">​</span></span></pre><pre class=" CodeMirror-line " role="presentation"><span role="presentation" style="padding-right: 0.1px;"><span class="cm-header cm-header-2">## 📌 Project Overview</span></span></pre><pre class=" CodeMirror-line " role="presentation"><span role="presentation" style="padding-right: 0.1px;"><span cm-text="">​</span></span></pre><pre class=" CodeMirror-line " role="presentation"><span role="presentation" style="padding-right: 0.1px;">This project analyzes sales transaction data to identify key</span></pre><pre class=" CodeMirror-line " role="presentation"><span role="presentation" style="padding-right: 0.1px;">business trends, profitability patterns, regional performance,</span></pre><pre class=" CodeMirror-line " role="presentation"><span role="presentation" style="padding-right: 0.1px;">category contribution, product demand, and monthly sales trends.</span></pre><pre class=" CodeMirror-line " role="presentation"><span role="presentation" style="padding-right: 0.1px;"><span cm-text="">​</span></span></pre><pre class=" CodeMirror-line " role="presentation"><span role="presentation" style="padding-right: 0.1px;">The objective is to transform raw sales data into actionable</span></pre><pre class=" CodeMirror-line " role="presentation"><span role="presentation" style="padding-right: 0.1px;">business insights that can support data-driven decision-making.</span></pre><pre class=" CodeMirror-line " role="presentation"><span role="presentation" style="padding-right: 0.1px;"><span cm-text="">​</span></span></pre><pre class=" CodeMirror-line " role="presentation"><span role="presentation" style="padding-right: 0.1px;"><span class="cm-header cm-header-3">### Key Business Questions</span></span></pre><pre class=" CodeMirror-line " role="presentation"><span role="presentation" style="padding-right: 0.1px;"><span cm-text="">​</span></span></pre><pre class=" CodeMirror-line " role="presentation"><span role="presentation" style="padding-right: 0.1px;"><span class="cm-variable-2">- How is the business performing overall?</span></span></pre><pre class=" CodeMirror-line " role="presentation"><span role="presentation" style="padding-right: 0.1px;"><span class="cm-variable-2">- Which regions generate the strongest profitability?</span></span></pre><pre class=" CodeMirror-line " role="presentation"><span role="presentation" style="padding-right: 0.1px;"><span class="cm-variable-2">- Which categories drive revenue and profit?</span></span></pre><pre class=" CodeMirror-line " role="presentation"><span role="presentation" style="padding-right: 0.1px;"><span class="cm-variable-2">- Which products generate the highest sales?</span></span></pre><pre class=" CodeMirror-line " role="presentation"><span role="presentation" style="padding-right: 0.1px;"><span class="cm-variable-2">- How does sales performance change over time?</span></span></pre><pre class=" CodeMirror-line " role="presentation"><span role="presentation" style="padding-right: 0.1px;"><span class="cm-variable-2">- Which areas provide opportunities for improvement?</span></span></pre></div></div></div></div></div><div style="position: absolute; height: 34px; width: 1px; border-bottom: 0px solid transparent; top: 464px;"></div><div class="CodeMirror-gutters" style="display: none; height: 498px;"></div></div></div></div><div class="text_cell_render rendered_html" tabindex="-1"><p>Type <em>Markdown</em> and LaTeX: <span class="MathJax_Preview" style="color: inherit;"></span><span class="MathJax" id="MathJax-Element-2-Frame" tabindex="0" data-mathml="&lt;math xmlns=&quot;http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML&quot;&gt;&lt;msup&gt;&lt;mi&gt;&amp;#x03B1;&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;mn&gt;2&lt;/mn&gt;&lt;/msup&gt;&lt;/math&gt;" role="presentation" style="position: relative;"><nobr aria-hidden="true"><span class="math" id="MathJax-Span-6" style="width: 1.285em; display: inline-block;"><span style="display: inline-block; position: relative; width: 1.029em; height: 0px; font-size: 120%;"><span style="position: absolute; clip: rect(1.157em, 1001.03em, 2.375em, -999.997em); top: -2.176em; left: 0em;"><span class="mrow" id="MathJax-Span-7"><span class="msubsup" id="MathJax-Span-8"><span style="display: inline-block; position: relative; width: 1.029em; height: 0px;"><span style="position: absolute; clip: rect(3.337em, 1000.52em, 4.17em, -999.997em); top: -3.971em; left: 0em;"><span class="mi" id="MathJax-Span-9" style="font-family: STIXMathJax_Normal-italic;">𝛼<span style="display: inline-block; overflow: hidden; height: 1px; width: 0.003em;"></span></span><span style="display: inline-block; width: 0px; height: 3.978em;"></span></span><span st